#: 3D/3d_align_surface.md
msgid ""
"This recipe builds on the basic {{< gd-icon CharacterBody3D "
">}}`CharacterBody3D` controller described in the [CharacterBody3D: "
"Movement](/godot_recipes/4.x/3d/characterbody3d_examples/) recipe, so read "
"that one first."
msgstr ""
"このレシピは[キャラクターボディ3D：移動制御](/godot_recipes/4.x/3d/characterbody3d_examples/) "
"レシピで解説されている基本の{{< gd-icon CharacterBody3D "
">}}`CharacterBody3D`コントローラーを拡張する内容となっています。まずはそちらを先にお読みください。"

#: 3D/3d_align_surface.md
msgid ""
"This is much better, but because we are instantly snapping to the new "
"alignment every time the tank crosses an edge, it still looks a little "
"jarring:"
msgstr "これはかなり改善されましたが、タンクがエッジを越えるたびに瞬時に整列するため、まだ少し不自然に見えます："

#: 3D/3d_align_surface.md
msgid ""
"We can solve this last problem by interpolating to the new transform rather "
"than snapping immediately to it."
msgstr "この最終問題は、即座にスナップするのではなく、新しい変換に補間することで解決できます。"

#: 3D/3d_align_surface.md
msgid "The result is much smoother and more pleasing:"
msgstr "結果は非常に滑らかでより魅力的なものになります："

#: 3D/3d_align_surface.md
msgid "### Surface normals"
msgstr "### 表面法線ベクトル"

#: 3D/3d_align_surface.md
msgid "To do this, we'll use the following function:"
msgstr "これを実現するには、以下の関数を使用します："

#: 3D/3d_align_surface.md
msgid ""
"We can update the tank's movement code to call this function when it collides "
"with a surface:"
msgstr "タンクの移動コードを更新して、表面が衝突した際にこの関数を呼び出せるようにしましょう："

#: 3D/3d_align_surface.md
msgid ""
"Since this raycast is pointing down from the exact center of the tank, we'll "
"align with the individual surface that it collides with - the one directly "
"beneath the tank."
msgstr "このレイキャストが戦車の中心真下から下方向に発射されているため、衝突する個別の面、すなわち戦車直下の表面に整列させます。"

#: 3D/3d_align_surface.md
msgid ""
"<video controls src=\"/godot_recipes/4.x/img/3d_kinematic_08.webm\"></video>"
msgstr ""
"<video controls src=\"/godot_recipes/4.x/img/3d_kinematic_08.webm\"></video>"

