#: 3D/3d_sphere_car.md
msgid "#### Ball"
msgstr "#### ボール"

#: 3D/3d_sphere_car.md
msgid ""
"In `_physics_process()` we add a force to the body based on the direction the "
"car is pointing, as well as keeping the car mesh positioned at the ball's "
"position:"
msgstr ""
"void _physics_process()\n"
"{\n"
"    // 車の向きに基づいて車体に力を加え、さらに車メッシュをボールの位置に固定します：\n"
"    float3 force = vehicle->GetForwardVector() * kCarForceMagnitude;\n"
"    vehicle->AddForceAtPosition(force, ballPosition);\n"
"\n"
"    // 車メッシュの位置をボールの位置に設定\n"
"    meshComponent->SetLocalTranslation(ballPosition);\n"
"}"

