#: 3D/3d_sphere_car.md
msgid ""
"Next, still in the `_process()` function, we'll rotate the car mesh based on "
"the rotation input. We'll use `slerp()` (spherical linear interpolation) to "
"do this smoothly:"
msgstr ""
"```python\n"
"# 回転入力に基づいて車のメッシュを滑らかに回転させる\n"
"mesh = gltf_model[\"geometry\"][0]  # GLTFモデルからジオメトリを取得\n"
"\n"
"def _process():\n"
"    global mesh\n"
"    rotation_input = parse_mouse_movement()  # マウス移動から回転データを取得\n"
"\n"
"    # slerpを使用して滑らかな補間を実行\n"
"    current_time = time.time()\n"
"    target_transform = transform_matrix * rotation_matrix\n"
"    current_transform = matrix_from_vectors(mesh[\"position\"], "
"mesh[\"rotation\"])\n"
"\n"
"    interpolation_factor = lerp_to_t(current_time - start_time, 0, 1)\n"
"    interpolated_transform = slerp(current_transform, target_transform, "
"interpolation_factor)\n"
"\n"
"    # 更新された変換行列を設定\n"
"    gltf_model[\"geometry\"][0][\"matrix\"] = "
"matrix_from_vectors(*interpolated_transform)\n"
"```"

