"`relative`プロパティを使用してピッチとヨー入力を設定する方法が有効です。"

#: 3D/basic_fps.md
msgid ""
"{{% notice style=\"note\" title=\"Where's the body?\" %}}\n"
"For this example, we'll leave the character \"bodyless\" - meaning we're not "
"adding a mesh to display for the player's body. Depending on your setup, you "
