msgstr "我們將標識的位置和玩家目標設置為所點擊的位置："

#: 3D/click_to_move.md
msgid ""
"We'll start with a flat plane for our world. Our actor will move on this "
"plane."
msgstr "まず、私たちの世界として平面から始めましょう。俳優はこの平面上を移動します。"

#: 3D/click_to_move.md
msgid ""
"While this can be done manually using the {{< gd-icon Camera3D "
">}}`Camera3D`'s `project_ray` methods, we can take advantage of the fact that "
"{{< gd-icon CollisionObject3D >}}`CollisionObject3D` nodes do this "
"automatically. All we need to do is connect our {{< gd-icon StaticBody3D "
">}}`StaticBody3D` ground's `input_event` signal:"
msgstr ""
"# Example function to simulate raycasting from static bodies\n"
"def get_raycast_results():\n"
"    results = []\n"
"    for body in static_objects:\n"
"        if body.is_static_body and body.has_input_event:\n"
"            event_data = body.input_event.wait_for_event()\n"
"            if event_data is not None:\n"
"                # Process the raycast results as needed\n"
"                pass\n"
"    return results"

#: 3D/click_to_move.md
