#: g101/3d/101_3d_03.md
msgid "Change the `get_input()` function like so:"
msgstr ""
"```python\n"
"def get_input():\n"
"    while True:\n"
"        try:\n"
"            user_input = input(\"Enter a number: \")\n"
"            num = float(user_input)\n"
"            return num\n"
"        except ValueError:\n"
"            print(\"無効な入力です。数字を入力してください。\")\n"
"```"

#: g101/3d/101_3d_03.md
msgid "### The Power of Transforms"
msgstr "### 変換の力"

#: g101/3d/101_3d_03.md
msgid ""
"Let's also add a {{< gd-icon Camera3D >}}`Camera3D` to the scene, so it will "
"follow the player around. Position the camera behind and above the character, "
"angling it down a bit. Click the \"Preview\" button to check the camera's "
"view."
msgstr ""
"シーンに `{{< gd-icon Camera3D >}}`カメラ` "
"オブジェクトも追加しましょう。プレイヤーが移動すると追従するように設定します。キャラクターの後方かつ少し上方に配置し、わずかに下向きに角度を調整してください"
"。「プレビュー」ボタンをクリックするとカメラアングルを確認できます。"

#: g101/3d/101_3d_03.md
msgid ""
"By multiplying the input vector by the `transform.basis`, we *apply* that "
"transformation to the vector. Since the basis represents the object's "
"rotation, we've now converted forward and back to point along the object's "
"**Z** axis, and the strafe keys along its **X**."
msgstr ""
"```python\n"
"# 基底ベクトルで入力ベクトルを乗算することで、変換を適用します\n"
"transformed_vector = transform.basis * input_vector\n"
"\n"
"# 基底はオブジェクトの回転を表すため、前方/後方方向がオブジェクトの Z軸方向に、左右移動方向が X軸方向に揃うようになりました"

#: g101/3d/101_3d_03.md
msgid ""
"Now we're going to make a character so we can walk around on the "
"platforms.\n"
"Open a new scene and start with a {{< gd-icon CharacterBody3D "
">}}`CharacterBody3D` named \"Character\". This `PhysicsBody` node behaves "
"very much like its 2D equivalent (you've already done the 2D tutorials, "
"right?). It has a `move_and_slide()` method that we'll use to perform the "
"movement and collision detection."
msgstr ""
"次に、プラットフォーム上を歩き回れるようにキャラクターを作成します。\n"
"新しいシーンを開き、\"Character\"という名前の{{< gd-icon CharacterBody3D "
">}}`CharacterBody3D`コンポーネントを追加します。この`PhysicsBody`ノードは2D版とほぼ同じ動作をします（2Dチュートリアルは"
"既に習得済みですよね？）。このコンポーネントには`move_and_slide()`メソッドが用意されており、これを使って移動と衝突検出を行います。"

#: g101/3d/101_3d_03.md
msgid "Now let's add a script to the body."
msgstr "それでは、ボディ部分にスクリプトを追加しましょう。"

#: g101/3d/101_3d_01.md
#: g101/3d/101_3d_02.md
#: g101/3d/101_3d_03.md
#: g101/3d/101_3d_04.md
