#: kyn/raycast2d.md
msgid ""
"Fast-moving projectiles often have the problem of \"tunneling\" through "
"obstacles - they are moving too fast for the collision to be detected in a "
"single frame. As an alternative, you can use a {{< gd-icon RayCast2D "
