"animation](/godot_recipes/4.x/animation/spritesheet_animation/)\n"
"- [Top-down character](/godot_recipes/4.x/2d/topdown_movement/#option-2-"
"rotate-and-move)\n"
"- [Transforms](/godot_recipes/4.x/math/transforms)"
msgstr ""
