#: physics/character_vs_rigid.md
msgid "We'll try out both options below."
msgstr "以下の両方のオプションを試してみましょう。"

#: physics/character_vs_rigid.md
msgid ""
"You'll need to adjust the `push_force` in relation to the mass of your rigid "
"bodies. Too high a force will still cause clipping, while too low will "
"prevent pushing at all."
msgstr ""
"剛性体の質量と関連させて `push_force` "
"を調整する必要があります。力が大きすぎると衝突が発生してしまいますし、小さすぎると全く押し込めなくなります。"

