"behavior. Adjusting them can drastically change how the car drives. To make "
"experimenting with different values easier, download the project for this "
"recipe below. When you run the game, you'll see a set of sliders you can use "
"to change the car's behavior as you drive (press `<Tab>` to show/hide the "
"slider panel)."
msgstr ""
"この時点で、車両の挙動を制御する多数の設定項目が存在します。これらを調整することで、車の運転特性を大きく変更することが可能です。さまざまな値を試す作業をより"
